  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NGO &#xab;PAROSTOK&#xbb;: Voice Power: Advocacy School for Women&quot;</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="FI">NGO &#xab;PAROSTOK&#xbb;: Voice Power: Advocacy School for Women&quot;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The NGO &quot;Parostok&quot; implements the project &#x201c;Voice Power: Advocacy School for Women&#x201d;, with a duration of 12 months. The project aims to empower women with disabilities to actively engage in public life and decision-making processes. Key activities include an online course for 50 participants, an offline training in Vinnytsia, a mentoring program for 10 women who will implement advocacy initiatives, and a final Leadership Forum. Expected result: increased participation of women with disabilities in civic life.</narrative>
